---
description: bheeagles.com redesign — follow the handoff spec when touching UI
globs: ["**/*.{tsx,jsx,ts,js,html,css,scss,vue,svelte,astro,mdx}"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- The source of truth for UI is `bhe-redesign-handoff/SPEC.md`; mockups live in `bhe-redesign-handoff/reference/`.
- Use only the design tokens (bhe-* colors, display/body fonts, radii); no ad-hoc hex values.
- Headings use Bricolage Grotesque at weight 800 with tight negative letter-spacing; body text uses Figtree.
- Buttons and chips are pill-shaped (999px radius). Primary is green with cream text; the accent (Give, final submit) is gold with green text; secondary is a 2px green outline.
- Gold is never used for text on light backgrounds (it fails contrast). Use it for fills, or for text on green only.
- Every page uses the shared Header and Footer. The footer keeps all eight Quick Links: Annual Fund, Reimbursement, News, Events, Get Involved, Parents, Archive, Newsletter Signup.
- Touch targets are at least 44px, and every input has a `<label>`. Icon-only buttons need an `aria-label`. Decorative SVGs get `aria-hidden="true"`.
- Never invent content for bracketed placeholders like `[TIME]` or `[EIN]`; keep them or wire them to real data.
- Keep existing integrations: donation links, Cloudflare Turnstile on newsletter and reimbursement, and the reimbursement submission backend.
